# Secrets — NEVER commit. The public .cer (signing/*.cer) is intentionally
# tracked and carries no private key; everything else here is belt to GitHub
# push protection's braces, which only recognises known credential formats and
# would not stop a hand-rolled .pem or a stray .env.
*.pfx
*.p12
*.snk
*.key
*.pem
*.jks
*.keystore
.env
.env.*
secrets.json
appsettings.*.local.json

# Rider / JetBrains
.idea/
*.DotSettings.user

# macOS / Windows noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*:Zone.Identifier

# AI assistant leftovers. These accumulate silently and are the maintainer's
# working context, not documentation. CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md were committed once
# by accident and had to be scrubbed from history before this repo went public;
# that scrub is no longer possible now that forks can exist, so keep this list
# ahead of whatever tool gets used next.
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md
.claude/
.codex/
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.windsurfrules
.aider*
.mcp.json
SESSION_*

# Maintainer's working journal. Deliberately untracked: it is a dev log of
# machine-specific state and dead ends, not documentation. Keep your own copy
# backed up somewhere, because the repo no longer does it for you.
PLAN.md